## update-ui: update_ui.rs

update-ui-title = Update from DXF/DWG
update-ui-intro = Brings a new revision of an imported drawing into the document. Added objects are green, changed objects are orange, and removed objects are drawn as ghosts where they were. Choose the changes to apply, then press Apply. Nothing changes until then.
update-ui-filter = DXF and DWG drawings
update-ui-file = New revision: { $name }
update-ui-drawing = Drawing: { $drawing }
update-ui-old-base = Compared with the update data that the document keeps.
update-ui-old-link = Compared with the linked original file.
update-ui-old-file = Compared with the old file that you gave.
update-ui-unchanged = { $count } unchanged
update-ui-no-changes = The new revision has no changes.
update-ui-truncated = The comparison stopped at a limit. Some changes may show as a removal and an addition.
update-ui-conflicts = { $count } changes concern objects that you edited. They are not accepted, so your edits stay. Tick one to replace your edit.
update-ui-conflict-mark = you edited this
update-ui-conflict-hint = You edited an object of this change, and the new revision changes it too. If you accept it, your edit is replaced.
update-ui-accept-all = Accept all
update-ui-reject-all = Reject all
update-ui-click = Tick the changes to apply. Click a change to zoom to it.
update-ui-more = There are more changes than the list shows.
update-ui-row-objects = { $count } objects
update-ui-apply = Apply { $count } changes
update-ui-cancel = Cancel
update-ui-close = Close
update-ui-read-only = The drawing shows the result of the update and is read only while this window is open.
update-ui-read-only-edit = The drawing is read only while the Update window is open. Apply or cancel the update first.
update-ui-expired = The drawing changed after the update was made, so the update is out of date.
update-ui-update-again = Update again
update-ui-pick-old = Choose the old file...
update-ui-pick-drawing = Several drawings were imported. Which one is this a new revision of?
update-ui-failed = The update failed: { $message }
update-ui-version-limit = The limit of versions is reached, so the update did not run and nothing changed. Delete versions in File > Versions, then press Apply again.
update-ui-done = Updated: { $added } objects added, { $replaced } changed, { $removed } removed. The versions before and after are saved; Undo takes the whole update back.
update-ui-what-geometry = shape
update-ui-what-layer = layer
update-ui-what-color = color
update-ui-what-linetype = line type
update-ui-what-lineweight = line weight
update-ui-what-text = text
update-ui-what-other = other
